Cell["\<\
The runs split between the two lobes, each driven to a definite verdict by \
its own outcomes. This is the outcome stream doing the observer's inference, \
the same accumulation a real experiment performs in software beside the \
detector. Now we turn on a potential and ask what survives.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2d0df906-1ebb-1081-5b32-f1609b4e62eb"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Part IV: The Harmonic Trap: Position Sharper Than the Ground State\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"519a4e0d-3467-bfb9-07ba-6057bd130583"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A trapped particle is never still: even in its ground state its position \
keeps the zero-point variance ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalSigma]", 
    StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"z", "p"}], "TI"]], "=", "\[HBar]", "/", "2", 
   StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["\[Omega]", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3a891815-8c00-cf41-6ab6-925f25ba95ab"],
 ", the ground state's own blur. So here is the question this Part answers: \
",
 StyleBox["watch that position continuously, and can the conditional state \
become sharper in position than the ground state itself? What does the state \
become?",
  FontWeight->"Bold"]
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0dbacffa-31b0-43f6-3b59-e6a4404511dc"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The harmonic trap is where this can be settled exactly. Because ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["H", "TI"], "^"], "=", 
   SuperscriptBox[
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["p", "TI"], "^"], "2"], "/", "2", 
   StyleBox["m", "TI"], "+", 
   FractionBox["1", "2"], 
   StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Omega]", "TI"], "2"], 
   SuperscriptBox[
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["x", "TI"], "^"], "2"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "196a859c-b643-c1b3-4f69-1cd9c3f79399"],
 " is quadratic, a conditional state that starts Gaussian stays Gaussian \
under both the measurement update and the evolution, so the whole state is \
five numbers: the two means ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["x", "TI"], "^"], 
    StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
     SpanMaxSize->1]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["p", "TI"], "^"], 
    StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
     SpanMaxSize->1]}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "48c8a383-1e42-ef31-78f7-3aed9bf4b21b"],
 " and the three covariances ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalSigma]", 
    StyleBox["x", "TI"]], "=", 
   StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   SuperscriptBox[
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["x", "TI"], "^"], "2"], 
   StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "-", 
   SuperscriptBox[
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["x", "TI"], "^"], 
     StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
      SpanMaxSize->1]}], "2"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "50735439-04fd-dee7-0001-4e63ac89a4cd"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["C", "TI"], "=", 
   FractionBox["1", "2"], 
   StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["x", "TI"], "^"]}], ",", 
    RowBox[{
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["p", "TI"], "^"], "}"}]}], 
   StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "-", 
   StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["x", "TI"], "^"], 
   StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["p", "TI"], "^"], 
   StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3597ba8d-914b-928f-63ac-33d720ffe0d5"],
 ", and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalSigma]", 
    StyleBox["p", "TI"]], "=", 
   StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   SuperscriptBox[
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["p", "TI"], "^"], "2"], 
   StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "-", 
   SuperscriptBox[
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["p", "TI"], "^"], 
     StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
      SpanMaxSize->1]}], "2"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "056fda38-a5bc-2884-3314-dc65cc497aee"],
 ". We can solve their steady state with algebra before ever touching the \
grid. (This is also the real setting of cavity and levitated optomechanics, \
where light monitors a mechanical mode.)"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"383c4a9f-130c-f8c1-69c4-63d9a6beca2b"],

Cell["\<\
Feed the trap Hamiltonian into the stochastic Schr\[ODoubleDot]dinger \
equation of Part I and apply it to each moment with It\[OHat] calculus. The \
equations of motion split cleanly in two. The two means follow the classical \
Hamilton drift plus a measurement gain acting on the record's noise:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7b649e79-a2e1-7610-291b-1022d6945d7a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["x", "TI"], "^"], 
    StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
     SpanMaxSize->1], "=", 
    FractionBox[
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
       SpanMaxSize->1], 
      OverscriptBox[
       StyleBox["p", "TI"], "^"], 
      StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
       SpanMaxSize->1]}], 
     StyleBox["m", "TI"]], " ", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], "+", "2", 
    SqrtBox[
     StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"]], " ", 
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalSigma]", 
     StyleBox["x", "TI"]], " ", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["W", "TI"]}], ",", 
   "\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]\
\[NonBreakingSpace]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
       SpanMaxSize->1], 
      OverscriptBox[
       StyleBox["p", "TI"], "^"], 
      StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
       SpanMaxSize->1]}]}], "=", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", 
       StyleBox["m", "TI"]}], 
      SuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["\[Omega]", "TI"], "2"], 
      RowBox[{
       StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
        SpanMaxSize->1], 
       OverscriptBox[
        StyleBox["x", "TI"], "^"], 
       StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
        SpanMaxSize->1]}], " ", 
      StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["t", "TI"]}], "+", 
     RowBox[{"2", 
      SqrtBox[
       StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"]], " ", 
      StyleBox["C", "TI"], " ", 
      StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
      RowBox[{
       StyleBox["W", "TI"], "."}]}]}]}]}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",ExpressionUUID->"09cb884c-5fc8-b209-3fc8-22165a620153"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The three covariances follow a deterministic matrix Riccati flow, free of \
any ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox[
   RowBox[{"d", "W"}], "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "376c6589-bcca-29e8-5d14-7cd3357f7b32"],
 ":"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"667bb688-7420-22c7-0e18-2fd27dd5702d"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox["\[CapitalSigma]", "."], 
     StyleBox["x", "TI"]], "=", 
    FractionBox[
     RowBox[{"2", 
      StyleBox["C", "TI"]}], 
     StyleBox["m", "TI"]], "-", "4", 
    StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"], " ", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalSigma]", 
     StyleBox["x", "TI"], "2"]}], ",", 
   "\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]\
\[NonBreakingSpace]", 
   RowBox[{
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["C", "TI"], "."], "=", 
    RowBox[{
     FractionBox[
      SubscriptBox["\[CapitalSigma]", 
       StyleBox["p", "TI"]], 
      StyleBox["m", "TI"]], "-", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
      SuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["\[Omega]", "TI"], "2"], 
      SubscriptBox["\[CapitalSigma]", 
       StyleBox["x", "TI"]]}], "-", 
     RowBox[{"4", 
      StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"], " ", 
      SubscriptBox["\[CapitalSigma]", 
       StyleBox["x", "TI"]], 
      StyleBox["C", "TI"]}]}]}], ",", 
   "\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]\
\[NonBreakingSpace]", 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox["\[CapitalSigma]", "."], 
     StyleBox["p", "TI"]], "=", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", "2"}], 
      StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
      SuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["\[Omega]", "TI"], "2"], 
      StyleBox["C", "TI"]}], "+", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"], 
      SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"]}], "-", 
     RowBox[{"4", 
      StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"], " ", 
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["C", "TI"], "2"], "."}]}]}]}]}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",ExpressionUUID->"72002252-da4c-5210-223f-c41fdff9217a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The split is the whole reason the trap is solvable: the covariance rates \
depend only on the covariances, never on the means or the noise, so they \
close among themselves and run deterministically. Keeping ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"], ",", 
   StyleBox["\[Omega]", "TI"], ",", 
   StyleBox["m", "TI"], ",", "\[HBar]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "084561a7-5440-aaee-387b-78015dfaf834"],
 " symbolic, write the three rates as a vector:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"721e71e5-9ca7-ded5-2226-68cf1553a43f"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", 
   RowBox[{
   "\[CapitalSigma]x", ",", " ", "Cc", ",", " ", "\[CapitalSigma]p", ",", " ",
     "\[Lambda]", ",", " ", "\[Omega]", ",", " ", "m", ",", " ", "\[HBar]", ",",
     " ", "\[Eta]", ",", " ", "\[Sigma]"}], "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"riccati", " ", "=", " ", 
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"2", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Cc", "/", "m"}]}], " ", "-", " ", 
     RowBox[{"4", " ", "\[Lambda]", " ", 
      RowBox[{"\[CapitalSigma]x", "^", "2"}]}]}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\[CapitalSigma]p", "/", "m"}], " ", "-", " ", 
     RowBox[{"m", " ", 
      RowBox[{"\[Omega]", "^", "2"}], " ", "\[CapitalSigma]x"}], " ", "-", 
     " ", 
     RowBox[{"4", " ", "\[Lambda]", " ", "\[CapitalSigma]x", " ", "Cc"}]}], ",",
     " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", "2"}], " ", "m", " ", 
      RowBox[{"\[Omega]", "^", "2"}], " ", "Cc"}], " ", "+", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\[Lambda]", " ", 
      RowBox[{"\[HBar]", "^", "2"}]}], " ", "-", " ", 
     RowBox[{"4", " ", "\[Lambda]", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Cc", "^", "2"}]}]}]}], "}"}]}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[58]:=",ExpressionUUID->"0a84e7eb-55e0-1894-3abb-feb563956afe"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox[
     RowBox[{"2", " ", "Cc"}], "m"], "-", 
    RowBox[{"4", " ", "\[Lambda]", " ", 
     SuperscriptBox["\[CapitalSigma]x", "2"]}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox["\[CapitalSigma]p", "m"], "-", 
    RowBox[{"4", " ", "Cc", " ", "\[Lambda]", " ", "\[CapitalSigma]x"}], "-", 
    
    RowBox[{"m", " ", "\[CapitalSigma]x", " ", 
     SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "2"]}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"-", "4"}], " ", 
     SuperscriptBox["Cc", "2"], " ", "\[Lambda]"}], "-", 
    RowBox[{"2", " ", "Cc", " ", "m", " ", 
     SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "2"]}], "+", 
    RowBox[{"\[Lambda]", " ", 
     SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"]}]}]}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.994961737687901*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[59]=",ExpressionUUID->"160cebcb-2b64-4468-b841-cbccad639592"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["Solve for the fixed point where all three rates vanish:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4ebe3b2c-9c8f-bd2d-7645-b376153b0477"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"steady", " ", "=", " ", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"SolveValues", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Thread", "[", 
      RowBox[{"riccati", " ", "==", " ", "0"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
      "\[CapitalSigma]x", ",", " ", "Cc", ",", " ", "\[CapitalSigma]p"}], 
      "}"}]}], "]"}], " ", "//", " ", "FullSimplify"}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[60]:=",ExpressionUUID->"7d6a0058-fb4a-caff-2b69-9a05fefc98c5"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"-", 
      FractionBox[
       SqrtBox[
        RowBox[{"-", 
         FractionBox[
          RowBox[{
           SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "2"], "+", 
           FractionBox[
            SqrtBox[
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               SuperscriptBox["m", "4"], " ", 
               SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "4"]}], "+", 
              RowBox[{"4", " ", 
               SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], " ", 
               SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"], " ", 
               SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"]}]}]], 
            SuperscriptBox["m", "2"]]}], 
          SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"]]}]], 
       RowBox[{"2", " ", 
        SqrtBox["2"]}]]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"-", 
      FractionBox[
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "2"]}], "+", 
        SqrtBox[
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           SuperscriptBox["m", "4"], " ", 
           SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "4"]}], "+", 
          RowBox[{"4", " ", 
           SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], " ", 
           SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"], " ", 
           SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"]}]}]]}], 
       RowBox[{"4", " ", "m", " ", "\[Lambda]"}]]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{
      FractionBox["1", "2"], " ", 
      SqrtBox[
       RowBox[{
        FractionBox[
         RowBox[{
          SuperscriptBox["m", "4"], " ", 
          SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "4"]}], "2"], "+", 
        RowBox[{"2", " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"], " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"]}]}]], " ", 
      SqrtBox[
       RowBox[{"-", 
        FractionBox[
         RowBox[{
          SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "2"], "+", 
          FractionBox[
           SqrtBox[
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              SuperscriptBox["m", "4"], " ", 
              SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "4"]}], "+", 
             RowBox[{"4", " ", 
              SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], " ", 
              SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"], " ", 
              SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"]}]}]], 
           SuperscriptBox["m", "2"]]}], 
         SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"]]}]]}]}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     FractionBox[
      SqrtBox[
       RowBox[{"-", 
        FractionBox[
         RowBox[{
          SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "2"], "+", 
          FractionBox[
           SqrtBox[
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              SuperscriptBox["m", "4"], " ", 
              SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "4"]}], "+", 
             RowBox[{"4", " ", 
              SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], " ", 
              SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"], " ", 
              SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"]}]}]], 
           SuperscriptBox["m", "2"]]}], 
         SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"]]}]], 
      RowBox[{"2", " ", 
       SqrtBox["2"]}]], ",", 
     RowBox[{"-", 
      FractionBox[
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "2"]}], "+", 
        SqrtBox[
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           SuperscriptBox["m", "4"], " ", 
           SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "4"]}], "+", 
          RowBox[{"4", " ", 
           SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], " ", 
           SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"], " ", 
           SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"]}]}]]}], 
       RowBox[{"4", " ", "m", " ", "\[Lambda]"}]]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", 
       FractionBox["1", "2"]}], " ", 
      SqrtBox[
       RowBox[{
        FractionBox[
         RowBox[{
          SuperscriptBox["m", "4"], " ", 
          SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "4"]}], "2"], "+", 
        RowBox[{"2", " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"], " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"]}]}]], " ", 
      SqrtBox[
       RowBox[{"-", 
        FractionBox[
         RowBox[{
          SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "2"], "+", 
          FractionBox[
           SqrtBox[
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              SuperscriptBox["m", "4"], " ", 
              SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "4"]}], "+", 
             RowBox[{"4", " ", 
              SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], " ", 
              SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"], " ", 
              SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"]}]}]], 
           SuperscriptBox["m", "2"]]}], 
         SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"]]}]]}]}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"-", 
      SqrtBox[
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", 
         FractionBox[
          SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "2"], 
          RowBox[{"8", " ", 
           SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"]}]]}], "+", 
        FractionBox[
         SqrtBox[
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            SuperscriptBox["m", "4"], " ", 
            SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "4"]}], "+", 
           RowBox[{"4", " ", 
            SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], " ", 
            SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"], " ", 
            SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"]}]}]], 
         RowBox[{"8", " ", 
          SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], " ", 
          SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"]}]]}]]}], ",", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", 
         SuperscriptBox["m", "2"]}], " ", 
        SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "2"]}], "+", 
       SqrtBox[
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          SuperscriptBox["m", "4"], " ", 
          SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "4"]}], "+", 
         RowBox[{"4", " ", 
          SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], " ", 
          SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"], " ", 
          SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"]}]}]]}], 
      RowBox[{"4", " ", "m", " ", "\[Lambda]"}]], ",", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", 
       FractionBox["1", "2"]}], " ", 
      SqrtBox[
       RowBox[{
        FractionBox[
         RowBox[{
          SuperscriptBox["m", "4"], " ", 
          SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "4"]}], "2"], "+", 
        RowBox[{"2", " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"], " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"]}]}]], " ", 
      SqrtBox[
       FractionBox[
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"-", 
           SuperscriptBox["m", "2"]}], " ", 
          SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "2"]}], "+", 
         SqrtBox[
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            SuperscriptBox["m", "4"], " ", 
            SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "4"]}], "+", 
           RowBox[{"4", " ", 
            SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], " ", 
            SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"], " ", 
            SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"]}]}]]}], 
        RowBox[{
         SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"]}]]]}]}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     SqrtBox[
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", 
        FractionBox[
         SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "2"], 
         RowBox[{"8", " ", 
          SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"]}]]}], "+", 
       FractionBox[
        SqrtBox[
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           SuperscriptBox["m", "4"], " ", 
           SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "4"]}], "+", 
          RowBox[{"4", " ", 
           SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], " ", 
           SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"], " ", 
           SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"]}]}]], 
        RowBox[{"8", " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"]}]]}]], ",", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", 
         SuperscriptBox["m", "2"]}], " ", 
        SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "2"]}], "+", 
       SqrtBox[
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          SuperscriptBox["m", "4"], " ", 
          SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "4"]}], "+", 
         RowBox[{"4", " ", 
          SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], " ", 
          SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"], " ", 
          SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"]}]}]]}], 
      RowBox[{"4", " ", "m", " ", "\[Lambda]"}]], ",", 
     RowBox[{
      FractionBox["1", "2"], " ", 
      SqrtBox[
       RowBox[{
        FractionBox[
         RowBox[{
          SuperscriptBox["m", "4"], " ", 
          SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "4"]}], "2"], "+", 
        RowBox[{"2", " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"], " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"]}]}]], " ", 
      SqrtBox[
       FractionBox[
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"-", 
           SuperscriptBox["m", "2"]}], " ", 
          SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "2"]}], "+", 
         SqrtBox[
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            SuperscriptBox["m", "4"], " ", 
            SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "4"]}], "+", 
           RowBox[{"4", " ", 
            SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], " ", 
            SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"], " ", 
            SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"]}]}]]}], 
        RowBox[{
         SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"]}]]]}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.994961738351274*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[60]=",ExpressionUUID->"a4cb3254-804d-4027-81a9-6c2ae3e98d76"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData["SolveValues"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5cc23ff5-bf0f-f019-04f1-b6bf3abbc363"],
 " returns several algebraic roots; the physical one has ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalSigma]", 
    StyleBox["x", "TI"]], ">", "0"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "29880975-91f0-008f-5fb7-a13f278552d5"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalSigma]", 
    StyleBox["p", "TI"]], ">", "0"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "551c00cf-fc58-99c4-0323-99a8f5d2eb2e"],
 ". Write a symbolic test for those signs, one that must hold for all ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["m", "TI"], ",", 
   StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\[HBar]", ">", "0"}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "22235db8-54be-42b7-53d1-54e25d4b109d"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Omega]", "TI"], "\[GreaterEqual]", "0"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0976d5ae-737d-f257-3f0d-cc080609c0bd"],
 ":"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"13e711b4-4d78-4d68-419c-88fe640d17b2"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"positiveQ", "[", "sol_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"TrueQ", "@", 
    RowBox[{"Resolve", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"ForAll", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
         "m", ",", " ", "\[Lambda]", ",", " ", "\[Omega]", ",", " ", 
          "\[HBar]"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"m", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\[Lambda]", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\[Omega]", " ", ">=", " ", "0"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\[HBar]", " ", ">", " ", "0"}]}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"sol", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "|", " ", 
            RowBox[{"sol", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}]}], ")"}], " ", "\[Element]", " ", 
          "Reals"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"sol", "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], " ", ">", " ", "0"}], " ", "&&", 
         " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"sol", "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}], " ", ">", " ", "0"}]}]}], "]"}], ",",
       " ", "Reals"}], "]"}]}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[61]:=",ExpressionUUID->"3fd09d86-aea1-a602-65ef-14e3cb550d68"],

Cell["Exactly one root passes it:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2f6c0922-6605-ed68-5513-a08c13b1b7b2"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"positiveQ", " ", "/@", " ", "steady"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[62]:=",ExpressionUUID->"2caab86a-2af9-b1b1-54a9-32344e8d039b"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{"False", ",", "False", ",", "False", ",", "True"}], "}"}]], "Output",\

 CellChangeTimes->{3.994961738561005*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[62]=",ExpressionUUID->"b9f44ca9-4732-4ffc-a8b3-f75a17937af2"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["Select that physical branch:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5b84d4d6-858d-5842-09bb-cd902c382aa8"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{
   "\[CapitalSigma]xSS", ",", " ", "CcSS", ",", " ", "\[CapitalSigma]pSS"}], 
   "}"}], " ", "=", " ", 
  RowBox[{"SelectFirst", "[", 
   RowBox[{"steady", ",", " ", "positiveQ"}], "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[63]:=",ExpressionUUID->"67558936-e5eb-8680-0d6a-2173939fecea"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   SqrtBox[
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"-", 
      FractionBox[
       SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "2"], 
       RowBox[{"8", " ", 
        SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"]}]]}], "+", 
     FractionBox[
      SqrtBox[
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         SuperscriptBox["m", "4"], " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "4"]}], "+", 
        RowBox[{"4", " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"], " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"]}]}]], 
      RowBox[{"8", " ", 
       SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], " ", 
       SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"]}]]}]], ",", 
   FractionBox[
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", 
       SuperscriptBox["m", "2"]}], " ", 
      SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "2"]}], "+", 
     SqrtBox[
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        SuperscriptBox["m", "4"], " ", 
        SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "4"]}], "+", 
       RowBox[{"4", " ", 
        SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], " ", 
        SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"], " ", 
        SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"]}]}]]}], 
    RowBox[{"4", " ", "m", " ", "\[Lambda]"}]], ",", 
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox["1", "2"], " ", 
    SqrtBox[
     RowBox[{
      FractionBox[
       RowBox[{
        SuperscriptBox["m", "4"], " ", 
        SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "4"]}], "2"], "+", 
      RowBox[{"2", " ", 
       SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], " ", 
       SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"], " ", 
       SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"]}]}]], " ", 
    SqrtBox[
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", 
         SuperscriptBox["m", "2"]}], " ", 
        SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "2"]}], "+", 
       SqrtBox[
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          SuperscriptBox["m", "4"], " ", 
          SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "4"]}], "+", 
         RowBox[{"4", " ", 
          SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], " ", 
          SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"], " ", 
          SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"]}]}]]}], 
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], " ", 
       SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"]}]]]}]}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.994961738653984*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[63]=",ExpressionUUID->"5bead0f9-ef55-4cbe-976e-7c7451c139a6"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The first entry is the steady position variance ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalSigma]", 
    StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"s", "s"}], "TI"]], "=", 
   FractionBox["1", 
    RowBox[{"2", 
     SqrtBox["2"]}]], 
   SqrtBox[
    FractionBox[
     RowBox[{"-", 
      StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
      SuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["\[Omega]", "TI"], "2"], "+", 
      SqrtBox[
       RowBox[{"4", 
        SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"], 
        SuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"], "2"], "+", 
        SuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["m", "TI"], "2"], 
        SuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["\[Omega]", "TI"], "4"]}]]}], 
     RowBox[{
      SuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"], "2"], 
      StyleBox["m", "TI"]}]]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3462f0a3-098c-f6b3-5c11-e90da83edc99"],
 ". Two checks that it is right. First, perfect measurement keeps the state \
pure, and a pure Gaussian sits exactly at the uncertainty floor, so ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalSigma]", 
    StyleBox["x", "TI"]], 
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalSigma]", 
    StyleBox["p", "TI"]], "-", 
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["C", "TI"], "2"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "04cac1af-436c-9192-2cc9-d809761ee3f8"],
 " must come out to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"], "/", "4"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "63be94f2-239e-9b81-1145-0dbc5628e9eb"],
 ":"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5a3d7a71-218e-1995-0bc3-7c3b503b6bff"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"\[CapitalSigma]xSS", " ", "\[CapitalSigma]pSS"}], " ", "-", " ", 
    
    RowBox[{"CcSS", "^", "2"}]}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\[Lambda]", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\[Omega]", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"m", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\[HBar]", " ", ">", " ", "0"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[64]:=",ExpressionUUID->"3a0f2024-2f71-09ca-6a34-b98e4a045b10"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FractionBox[
  SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"], "4"]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.994961738659534*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[64]=",ExpressionUUID->"40618d80-0841-4dc2-ac9d-41dacd8fcc9d"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Second, switching off the trap, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Omega]", "TI"], "\[Rule]", "0"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "178a6a52-23e4-1142-3d89-8c1c559163a8"],
 ", should return the free-particle steady value ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SqrtBox[
   RowBox[{"\[HBar]", "/", "4", 
    StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["m", "TI"]}]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "52ddf811-e480-8137-02e2-f25a8d3ad01d"],
 ":"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"719ae17a-c654-ed44-27b9-f927f3e6b7ae"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Limit", "[", 
    RowBox[{"\[CapitalSigma]xSS", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\[Omega]", " ", "->", " ", "0"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\[Lambda]", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"m", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\[HBar]", " ", ">", " ", "0"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[65]:=",ExpressionUUID->"62c8f42b-c628-388a-12f7-ee74f3c28ad0"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  FractionBox["1", "2"], " ", 
  SqrtBox[
   FractionBox["\[HBar]", 
    RowBox[{"m", " ", "\[Lambda]"}]]]}]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.994961739105836*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[65]=",ExpressionUUID->"75e00f5d-4750-41c5-a4a3-e87f68cf9e5b"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Both check out: the steady state is a pure Gaussian that reduces to the free \
particle when the trap is switched off.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7af061c8-c44a-ae8e-2a80-7895edfcf4d4"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Now the payoff, the question we opened with. Set the steady variance \
against the zero-point value ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalSigma]", 
    StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"z", "p"}], "TI"]], "=", "\[HBar]", "/", "2", 
   StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["\[Omega]", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0d437dad-8290-de9a-3b71-74f7372aa4e0"],
 " and simplify the ratio:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7aafc905-908a-67da-2a54-e16f213f4d20"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\[CapitalSigma]xSS", "/", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"\[HBar]", "/", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"2", " ", "m", " ", "\[Omega]"}], ")"}]}], ")"}]}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\[Lambda]", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\[Omega]", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"m", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\[HBar]", " ", ">", " ", "0"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[66]:=",ExpressionUUID->"62016b94-8ad8-fb56-123e-82de2f52c9bc"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FractionBox[
  RowBox[{"\[Omega]", " ", 
   SqrtBox[
    RowBox[{"m", " ", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", "m"}], " ", 
        SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "2"]}], "+", 
       SqrtBox[
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          SuperscriptBox["m", "2"], " ", 
          SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "4"]}], "+", 
         RowBox[{"4", " ", 
          SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"], " ", 
          SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"]}]}]]}], ")"}]}]]}], 
  RowBox[{
   SqrtBox["2"], " ", "\[Lambda]", " ", "\[HBar]"}]]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.994961739205122*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[66]=",ExpressionUUID->"b00a8581-47da-4464-a677-334b9da87c49"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "In the single dimensionless measurement strength ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Mu]", "TI"], "=", "2", "\[HBar]", 
   StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"], "/", 
   StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Omega]", "TI"], "2"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "30f601cf-5001-fb68-608d-98a961b5c9b2"],
 ", the above formula is exactly ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SqrtBox[
    RowBox[{"2", 
     StyleBox["(",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     RowBox[{
      SqrtBox[
       RowBox[{"1", "+", 
        SuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["\[Mu]", "TI"], "2"]}]], "-", "1"}], 
     StyleBox[")",
      SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "/", 
   StyleBox["\[Mu]", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "04bc0f0b-f02f-243d-2c43-a75481db8f07"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1a24bdc2-598a-1b95-4bdb-34ac583f69ff"],

Cell["Define a function, and the strength beside it:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"705e212e-f5a4-7717-2065-b88bfc515a7d"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"sqRatio", "[", "u_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
     RowBox[{"2", " ", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
         RowBox[{"1", " ", "+", " ", 
          RowBox[{"u", "^", "2"}]}], "]"}], " ", "-", " ", "1"}], ")"}]}], 
     "]"}], "/", "u"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"\[Mu]", " ", "=", " ", 
  RowBox[{"2", " ", "\[HBar]", " ", 
   RowBox[{"\[Lambda]", "/", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"m", " ", 
      RowBox[{"\[Omega]", "^", "2"}]}], ")"}]}]}]}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[67]:=",ExpressionUUID->"5c2f5325-a3f6-c048-05d5-4a8ed5809292"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FractionBox[
  RowBox[{"2", " ", "\[Lambda]", " ", "\[HBar]"}], 
  RowBox[{"m", " ", 
   SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", "2"]}]]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9949617392099*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[68]=",ExpressionUUID->"86c37bfb-82cd-4008-bf4e-87cdf5ab2423"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["And confirm the two forms agree:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"51e4dffc-d38f-5703-079b-d6b9e63a3a69"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"\[CapitalSigma]xSS", "/", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"\[HBar]", "/", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"2", " ", "m", " ", "\[Omega]"}], ")"}]}], ")"}]}], " ", "==",
     " ", 
    RowBox[{"sqRatio", "[", "\[Mu]", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\[Lambda]", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\[Omega]", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"m", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\[HBar]", " ", ">", " ", "0"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[69]:=",ExpressionUUID->"30e43b5d-74af-d0fb-609b-b3077d5ba2c1"],

Cell[BoxData["True"], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9949617395574217`*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[69]=",ExpressionUUID->"a19d370d-3889-40cb-9123-10011704b289"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "That ratio is below ",
 Cell[BoxData["1"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "36758762-649a-f7b1-5e0a-1f4c0d2cdd9b"],
 " for every ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Mu]", "TI"], ">", "0"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "138e1639-4d05-8b97-41b5-886364b1d9fd"],
 ", and it strictly falls as you watch harder; both are theorems, not plot \
impressions. First, that the ratio stays below one at every strength, so the \
position is squeezed below the vacuum however gently you watch:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"156728ce-0023-e03b-431c-c1a8b1d7b301"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Resolve", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"ForAll", "[", 
    RowBox[{"u", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"u", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"sqRatio", "[", "u", "]"}], " ", "<", " ", "1"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
   " ", "Reals"}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[70]:=",ExpressionUUID->"7fc37353-2ed8-42c8-25f1-6b1d4b6d1012"],

Cell[BoxData["True"], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9949617396327953`*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[70]=",ExpressionUUID->"2a3504e5-17cf-4bcb-82cc-0b3a1a445d95"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Second, that its slope is negative everywhere, so watching harder always \
squeezes the position further:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"07c988c4-3ef2-8066-2df6-21aeba84d34c"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Resolve", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"ForAll", "[", 
    RowBox[{"u", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"u", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"D", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"sqRatio", "[", "u", "]"}], ",", " ", "u"}], "]"}], " ", "<", 
      " ", "0"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", "Reals"}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[71]:=",ExpressionUUID->"4bc0a2f3-6150-447f-79ff-3bbd10e52f45"],

Cell[BoxData["True"], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.994961739651142*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[71]=",ExpressionUUID->"4747370c-9fa7-4865-99fe-e14933705add"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["Its weak-measurement limit:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3d863d84-94ab-5643-6bbd-b4ee1d5e3ca9"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Asymptotic", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"sqRatio", "[", "u", "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"u", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Assumptions", " ", "->", " ", 
    RowBox[{"u", " ", ">=", " ", "0"}]}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[72]:=",ExpressionUUID->"7ab8b877-e011-189c-2a47-323091a46ae6"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"1", "-", 
  FractionBox[
   SuperscriptBox["u", "2"], "8"]}]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.994961739691679*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[72]=",ExpressionUUID->"6fb3abcf-23b2-4c56-9bfd-1a446b7bc294"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["And its strong-measurement limit:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0da6433d-a7a4-ba24-3b5e-5b66d256090e"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Asymptotic", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"sqRatio", "[", "u", "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"u", ",", " ", "Infinity", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Assumptions", " ", "->", " ", 
    RowBox[{"u", " ", ">=", " ", "0"}]}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[73]:=",ExpressionUUID->"462f64f6-435d-c7dd-6fd5-7db076e9ad27"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FractionBox[
  SqrtBox["2"], 
  SqrtBox["u"]]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.994961739735663*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[73]=",ExpressionUUID->"3d4cba9b-82f6-44be-9c00-a293aef3fc1e"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "So the ratio is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[TildeTilde]", "1", "-", 
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Mu]", "TI"], "2"], "/", "8"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0fd1c247-21a4-d962-35ee-e4215056a848"],
 " for weak watching and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[TildeTilde]", 
   SqrtBox[
    RowBox[{"2", "/", 
     StyleBox["\[Mu]", "TI"]}]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "09347675-9fce-c17b-38cc-683f1a789041"],
 " for strong, and the whole curve between those limits stays under the \
vacuum line:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2c597ed5-00d9-d535-5467-779fb16dbc1f"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Plot", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"sqRatio", "[", "u", "]"}], ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"u", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "10"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"PlotStyle", " ", "->", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"Automatic", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Directive", "[", 
       RowBox[{"Gray", ",", " ", "Dashed"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"FrameLabel", " ", "->", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<strength \[Mu]\>\"", ",", 
      " ", "\"\<\[CapitalSigma]x(ss) / \[CapitalSigma]x(zp)\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",",
    "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{
   "PlotLabel", " ", "->", 
    " ", "\"\<The squeezing ratio stays below one at every strength\>\""}]}], 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[74]:=",ExpressionUUID->"66c4d8d6-27c8-a0db-0efb-d1905262f221"],

