Cell["\<\
The plot overlays two curves for the average position over time, and as with \
the lobe plot only one of them is something an experiment could actually \
draw. The red dashed curve is the estimate the five-number filter reports \
from nothing but the noisy stream of readings, so it is observable, the very \
quantity a real detector tracks. The gray curve is the average position \
carried by the full 256-amplitude wavefunction, and since no experiment holds \
that wavefunction it is not observable: it is drawn only as the reference to \
check the filter against, and the red lies right on top of it. The filter \
reaches it without ever building the wavefunction: it starts from the known \
initial state and, at each reading, nudges its running estimate by the \
surprise, how far the reading fell from what the estimate predicted, \
adjusting only its five numbers. So five numbers, driven by the raw signal \
alone, reproduce the average position that 256 complex amplitudes compute. \
That is what a real experiment does: to keep track of the particle's average \
position it never holds the wavefunction, it runs these five numbers in real \
time from the measured light, as a levitated nanoparticle or a vibrating \
membrane experiment does. Part III's outcomes answered a single yes-or-no \
question, which packet won; this one hands back the whole moving conditional \
mean.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7d81b9ce-3a4c-aa2a-2bbe-30a8bffef970"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["The Price of an Imperfect Detector", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"6bb9b374-9caf-337d-1946-2b3e155b9e47"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The perfect detector was a fiction, in two ways. The overlay a page ago \
only checked the model against itself, not against nature; a laboratory earns \
its model separately, by testing the filter's leftover noise for hidden \
structure and calibrating against an independent out-of-loop measurement. And \
a real detector catches only a fraction ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6c340229-13f4-0181-15cb-a473a58153eb"],
 " of the light the particle scatters, its ",
 StyleBox["detection efficiency", "TI"],
 " (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], "=", "1"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "25dfa134-0866-9bb5-53e4-397ea910e99f"],
 " is perfect, a separate dial from the rate ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "425139cc-45a5-cefb-726e-b0966c5194c1"],
 "). It is this second gap that separates the essay's below-the-vacuum result \
from the laboratory: with the same five-number filter inside a fuller noise \
model, a levitated nanoparticle has been tracked to ",
 ButtonBox["about $1.3$ times its zero-point motion",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["https://arxiv.org/abs/2012.15188"], None}],
 ", a spread ",
 StyleBox["above", "TI"],
 " the vacuum, not below (a ratio of standard deviations, about ",
 Cell[BoxData["1.7"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4d922994-f334-45bb-7ba1-c0d186c12f81"],
 " in the variance our ",
 Cell[BoxData["\[CapitalSigma]"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "06c25578-1780-b25e-2ef2-4d22a23a00a4"],
 "'s track). The rest of this section shows why missing light lands you \
there, and it takes no new equations."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5f70617e-b140-9f95-0500-793bc0fae5ff"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Light the detector misses still kicks the particle, but the information it \
carried is gone for good. So the record moves the state less than a perfect \
one would, while the kick it delivers stays full: in the covariance \
equations, every term that comes from watching picks up a factor ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "79d0371a-30a6-04e5-2fef-af4441536ecf"],
 ", and the disturbance term keeps its bare ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7d950d76-dd18-2b24-2baa-a533d4ad760e"],
 ","
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7234a9f4-3232-6781-23cb-40be47c74deb"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox["\[CapitalSigma]", "."], 
     StyleBox["x", "TI"]], "=", 
    FractionBox[
     RowBox[{"2", 
      StyleBox["C", "TI"]}], 
     StyleBox["m", "TI"]], "-", "4", 
    StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"], " ", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalSigma]", 
     StyleBox["x", "TI"], "2"]}], ",", 
   "\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]\
\[NonBreakingSpace]", 
   RowBox[{
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["C", "TI"], "."], "=", 
    RowBox[{
     FractionBox[
      SubscriptBox["\[CapitalSigma]", 
       StyleBox["p", "TI"]], 
      StyleBox["m", "TI"]], "-", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
      SuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["\[Omega]", "TI"], "2"], 
      SubscriptBox["\[CapitalSigma]", 
       StyleBox["x", "TI"]]}], "-", 
     RowBox[{"4", 
      StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"], " ", 
      SubscriptBox["\[CapitalSigma]", 
       StyleBox["x", "TI"]], 
      StyleBox["C", "TI"]}]}]}], ",", 
   "\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]\
\[NonBreakingSpace]", 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox["\[CapitalSigma]", "."], 
     StyleBox["p", "TI"]], "=", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", "2"}], 
      StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
      SuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["\[Omega]", "TI"], "2"], 
      StyleBox["C", "TI"]}], "+", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"], 
      SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"]}], "-", 
     RowBox[{"4", 
      StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"], " ", 
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["C", "TI"], "2"], "."}]}]}]}]}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",ExpressionUUID->"42668d78-f434-72a4-721d-2525fdc1408e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "which is just the ideal system with two numbers rescaled, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"], "\[Rule]", 
   StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0c7cc198-0ad8-2426-3403-d8c2af528f0c"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[HBar]", "\[Rule]", "\[HBar]", "/", 
   SqrtBox[
    StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "69698b1d-3dc2-3628-1f16-2347b4749d72"],
 ". The rescaling is built for exactly this: it leaves the disturbance term \
untouched, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"\[Eta]", "\[Lambda]"}], "TI"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   SuperscriptBox[
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["(",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     RowBox[{"\[HBar]", "/", 
      SqrtBox[
       StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"]]}], 
     StyleBox[")",
      SpanMaxSize->1]}], "2"], "=", 
   StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"], 
   SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "701e1eb7-eeba-61c8-2025-97f08b4f3312"],
 ", while every watching term picks up the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0e322415-281a-3695-37c1-be5f49ac9cff"],
 ". Because the rescaling turns the ideal equations into these, it also turns \
the ideal steady state into the one we need, with no re-solving:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"61beb272-ef15-9663-1745-343f8aa1fd49"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
    "\[CapitalSigma]xSS\[Eta]", ",", " ", "CcSS\[Eta]", ",", " ", 
     "\[CapitalSigma]pSS\[Eta]"}], "}"}], " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
     "\[CapitalSigma]xSS", ",", " ", "CcSS", ",", " ", "\[CapitalSigma]pSS"}],
      "}"}], " ", "/.", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"\[Lambda]", " ", "->", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\[Eta]", " ", "\[Lambda]"}]}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"\[HBar]", " ", "->", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\[HBar]", "/", 
        RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "\[Eta]", "]"}]}]}]}], "}"}]}]}], ";"}]], "Input",\

 CellLabel->"In[96]:=",ExpressionUUID->"5e8a6a96-06b4-6465-0689-83d0b3414f4f"],

Cell["\<\
The first cost is purity. A perfect measurement held the state exactly at the \
uncertainty limit; a lossy one holds it above that limit, by exactly the \
missing fraction:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"55951090-ef25-ccfd-03aa-89dd8ad196c7"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"\[CapitalSigma]xSS\[Eta]", " ", "\[CapitalSigma]pSS\[Eta]"}], 
    " ", "-", " ", 
    RowBox[{"CcSS\[Eta]", "^", "2"}]}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\[Lambda]", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\[Omega]", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"m", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\[HBar]", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"0", " ", "<", " ", "\[Eta]", " ", "<=", " ", "1"}]}], "}"}]}], 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[97]:=",ExpressionUUID->"53a2ca13-da2c-324e-0151-ec5cdfde8094"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FractionBox[
  SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"], 
  RowBox[{"4", " ", "\[Eta]"}]]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.994961740415408*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[97]=",ExpressionUUID->"22780a36-2ad7-4a84-8de8-d3f3cde99826"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The combination comes out ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"], "/", "4", 
   StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "76ba63e9-5df8-c241-1e5a-7ab3547290ab"],
 ", above the floor of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", "2"], "/", "4"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "319e51f9-a9ce-1d21-67a6-48a2c87b640b"],
 ": the conditional state is now mixed, because part of what the environment \
took never reached you. The squeezing ratio carries over just as cleanly,"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"26f4962c-805e-a216-4e8b-087631e8f17c"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox[
     RowBox[{
      SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalSigma]", 
       StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
       StyleBox[
        RowBox[{"s", "s"}], "TI"]], 
      StyleBox["(",
       SpanMaxSize->1], 
      StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], 
      StyleBox[")",
       SpanMaxSize->1]}], 
     SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalSigma]", 
      StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
      StyleBox[
       RowBox[{"z", "p"}], "TI"]]], "=", 
    FractionBox[
     SqrtBox[
      RowBox[{"2", 
       StyleBox["(",
        SpanMaxSize->1], 
       RowBox[{
        SqrtBox[
         RowBox[{"1", "+", 
          StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], 
          SuperscriptBox[
           StyleBox["\[Mu]", "TI"], "2"]}]], "-", "1"}], 
       StyleBox[")",
        SpanMaxSize->1]}]], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], " ", 
      StyleBox["\[Mu]", "TI"]}]]}], ","}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",ExpressionUUID->"313d5a7b-7caf-7acc-60c3-5c25755a4816"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "the perfect-detector ratio read at the weakened strength ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SqrtBox[
    StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"]], " ", 
   StyleBox["\[Mu]", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2da78195-91be-94f0-5b5c-18df2048feda"],
 " and divided by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SqrtBox[
   StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "39c6b7ab-78e0-e73c-6ffd-2ef5789aca06"],
 ":"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3f7d0c35-7157-44bf-6502-a67f00e22e85"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"\[CapitalSigma]xSS\[Eta]", "/", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"\[HBar]", "/", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"2", " ", "m", " ", "\[Omega]"}], ")"}]}], ")"}]}], " ", "==",
     " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"sqRatio", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "\[Eta]", "]"}], " ", "\[Mu]"}], "]"}], "/", 
     RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "\[Eta]", "]"}]}]}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\[Lambda]", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\[Omega]", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"m", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\[HBar]", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"0", " ", "<", " ", "\[Eta]", " ", "<=", " ", "1"}]}], "}"}]}], 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[98]:=",ExpressionUUID->"47b49f91-c3c7-4deb-6d4b-16daf6721731"],

Cell[BoxData["True"], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.994961740630699*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[98]=",ExpressionUUID->"f0eec977-0daa-46b8-83d8-b29c1e04e9c6"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The second cost is the headline. At ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], "=", "1"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "76c2caed-aea0-13a2-1ef1-e3b6cb556188"],
 " the ratio stayed below one at every strength; at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], "<", "1"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "260c3025-1fa9-9acd-4e33-a98f9a5de817"],
 " it starts ",
 StyleBox["above", "TI"],
 " one for weak watching (the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SqrtBox[
   StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4b1e6c2c-0452-4134-7925-8676ade7101e"],
 " in the denominator wins) and dips below the vacuum only past a finite \
threshold strength:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2982aea8-af87-65d7-5fb1-47f5ca324f3d"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"SolveValues", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"sqRatio", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "\[Eta]", "]"}], " ", "u"}], "]"}], "/", 
      RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "\[Eta]", "]"}]}], " ", "==", " ", "1"}], " ", "&&",
     " ", 
    RowBox[{"u", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
    RowBox[{"0", " ", "<", " ", "\[Eta]", " ", "<", " ", "1"}]}], ",", " ", 
   "u", ",", " ", "Reals"}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[99]:=",ExpressionUUID->"19ac3a5e-0cd6-873c-4f53-bc18a560ea06"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  TemplateBox[{
    SqrtBox[
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{"4", "-", 
        RowBox[{"4", " ", "\[Eta]"}]}], 
      SuperscriptBox["\[Eta]", "3"]]], 
    RowBox[{"0", "<", "\[Eta]", "<", "1"}]},
   "ConditionalExpression"], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.994961740695795*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[99]=",ExpressionUUID->"97ffb1a6-e54d-42ef-8c8e-236a74f6442b"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "So beating the vacuum survives any efficiency, but only beyond ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Mu]", "TI"], "*"], "=", "2", 
   SqrtBox[
    RowBox[{"1", "-", 
     StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"]}]], "/", 
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{"3", "/", "2"}]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2b6bc1ec-c569-bd9f-5968-d8c9ec1d07e5"],
 ": inefficiency raises the price, it never forbids it. A perfect detector \
pays nothing: at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], "=", "1"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "25f1a39a-81e0-db80-538e-3ac4379aa9ea"],
 " the extra threshold strength collapses to zero."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"35466be2-b7a8-26dc-637d-82cfc2428c26"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Limit", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"2", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
      RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", "\[Eta]"}], "]"}], "/", 
     RowBox[{"\[Eta]", "^", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"3", "/", "2"}], ")"}]}]}]}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"\[Eta]", " ", "->", " ", "1"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[100]:=",ExpressionUUID->"58bdea72-0ba3-5f4c-0842-0c3cae562596"],

Cell[BoxData["0"], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.994961740743993*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "Out[100]=",ExpressionUUID->"23b1dec0-3801-48ee-b5d4-0c26d44eea20"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A failing detector pays without bound: as the efficiency falls toward zero \
the threshold strength diverges as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"2", "/", 
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{"3", "/", "2"}]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0abc4047-6c7b-4886-3a44-5a21050e1aec"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"24e21d63-fe6b-5877-4c91-954cfb1e2b5d"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Asymptotic", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"2", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
      RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", "\[Eta]"}], "]"}], "/", 
     RowBox[{"\[Eta]", "^", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"3", "/", "2"}], ")"}]}]}]}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"\[Eta]", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Assumptions", " ", "->", " ", 
    RowBox[{"0", " ", "<", " ", "\[Eta]", " ", "<", " ", "1"}]}]}], 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[101]:=",ExpressionUUID->"348d2737-4aeb-e3cb-5cb2-bf716e9fb111"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FractionBox["2", 
  SuperscriptBox["\[Eta]", 
   RowBox[{"3", "/", "2"}]]]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.994961740748784*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "Out[101]=",ExpressionUUID->"aceb2fe1-931f-4b85-b751-85b0e7366f00"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["and the curve between the two ends prices every detector:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3cadbe4b-a339-c651-6452-3014d6cdacbb"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Plot", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"2", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
      RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", "\[Eta]"}], "]"}], "/", 
     RowBox[{"\[Eta]", "^", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"3", "/", "2"}], ")"}]}]}]}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"\[Eta]", ",", " ", "0.1", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"PlotRange", " ", "->", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "60"}], "}"}]}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"FrameLabel", " ", "->", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<efficiency \[Eta]\>\"", ",", 
      " ", "\"\<threshold strength \[Mu]*\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{
   "PlotLabel", " ", "->", 
    " ", "\"\<The price of inefficiency: the strength needed to beat the \
vacuum\>\""}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[102]:=",ExpressionUUID->"31169419-f57b-983b-672d-0e42fc0feb01"],

Cell[BoxData[
 GraphicsBox[
  InterpretationBox[{
    TagBox[{{{}, {}, 
       TagBox[
        {RGBColor[0.24, 0.6, 0.8], AbsoluteThickness[2], Opacity[1.], 
         LineBox[CompressedData["
